  heading: "The \"In-Tents\" Estate Pop-up Warehouse Sale"
  paragraphs:
    - "<strong>ALL ITEMS UNDER $50 ARE 50% OFF!!!</strong>"
    - "Come explore Gary Germer's estate warehouse sale where you will find a mix of estates and consigned pieces offering an expansive and diverse shopping experience at amazing prices. Since we can't let people into our physical warehouse due to logistical issues, we will be hosting the sale at the home of one of our current estate client's in the Laurelhurst/Sandy neighborhood. We have trucked over lots of great items for all types of shoppers from small tchotchkes to large pieces of furniture. We are making room for even more consigned estates so there will certainly be plenty of bargain prices you don't want to miss."
    - "There will be an assortment of fine art, sculptures, prints, and art glass pieces. Lots of kitchen accessories, pots, pans, china, bowls, including vintage glass and stemware. Quality rugs of all shapes and sizes, not to mention a 13x25ft Persian masterpiece. Vintage toys, games, antique figurines and other collectibles like movie posters and autographed photos from famous celebrities and athletes. One of a kind vintage bicucles. A trove of vintage jewelry and clothing from fashionable accessories to designer gowns and fur coats. There will be a range of furniture from antique to mid-century chairs, tables, wardrobes, trunks, and storage chests. Vintage signs and neons for former businesses. Plenty of Chinese, Japanese, and other artistic cultural works like vases, bowls, pottery, tea sets, art, and other traditional icons. Antique medieval and Nordic items, including religious items. Yard equipment, statues, and planters. We'll even have some firearms, weapons cases, swords, and tons of ammo. Plus all those popular estate sale treasures of electronics, DVDs, CDs, books, workshop and power tools, silver pieces, recreation and sporting supplies, lighting and lamps, home decor, Christmas, and so much more!"
